%% aoneahsan-cccs-story-craft — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Prose meant to move a reader]) --> bible{docs/story/story-bible.md<br/>exists AND approved?}
    bible -->|no| init[aoneahsan-cccs-story-bible<br/>/story-init → STOP at GATE 1]
    bible -->|yes| load[Load Bible + voice-fingerprint<br/>+ this surface's content-map row]
    load --> mapped{Surface in content-map.md?}
    mapped -->|no| cmap[aoneahsan-cccs-story-content-map<br/>→ STOP at GATE 2]
    mapped -->|yes| safety{Therapy / crisis / legal /<br/>medical / financial /<br/>error of consequence?}
    safety -->|yes| safe[references/safety.md<br/>humor OFF · gravity band]
    safety -->|no| pick
    safe --> pick[Pick the structure from the<br/>surface table → open its reference]
    pick --> draft[Draft: hook first · palette ratio ·<br/>jagged rhythm · one specific per section ·<br/>answer-first if indexed]
    draft --> invent{Would any fact, number,<br/>name or quote be invented?}
    invent -->|yes| nd[Write NEEDS DECISION: question<br/>never a guess]
    invent -->|no| banned
    nd --> banned{Any phrase from<br/>assets/banned-phrases.txt?}
    banned -->|yes| cut[Cut it, or allow with the<br/>documented marker + reason]
    cut --> banned
    banned -->|no| check[Self-check: palette · rhythm ·<br/>unsure spots]
    check --> hand([Hand to aoneahsan-cccs-story-orchestration<br/>for the review panel])

    load -.consult if present.-> law[(~/.claude/rules/storytelling-content.md)]

    classDef gate fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    class bible,mapped,safety,invent,banned gate
    class trigger,hand terminal
